# Runtime object storage only — `media_storage_dir` defaults to backend/data/storage.
# ANCHORED on purpose: an unanchored `data/` also swallowed backend/app/data/, which holds
# checked-in package data (the shared alarm keyword vocabulary). That failed silently — the
# file simply never appeared in `git status`.
